### Trouble for the fake data source (VS Code REST Client, Visual Studio, Rider). Backend: dotnet run --project backend/src/ObservabilityCity.Host
@host = http://localhost:5080

### High CPU on the Ledger API
POST {{host}}/api/fake/effects
Content-Type: application/json

{ "target": "cl.ledger-api", "kind": "HighCpu", "intensity": 0.9 }

### Dead letters building up in the Payments worker
POST {{host}}/api/fake/effects
Content-Type: application/json

{ "target": "pay.payments-worker", "kind": "Poison", "intensity": 1 }

### Payments queue backs up
POST {{host}}/api/fake/effects
Content-Type: application/json

{ "target": "pay.payments-worker", "kind": "Backlog", "intensity": 1 }

### Ledger API down
POST {{host}}/api/fake/effects
Content-Type: application/json

{ "target": "cl.ledger-api", "kind": "Down", "intensity": 1 }

### Screening API goes stale
POST {{host}}/api/fake/effects
Content-Type: application/json

{ "target": "frd.screening-api", "kind": "Stale", "intensity": 1 }

### Errors across the whole Payments island
POST {{host}}/api/fake/effects
Content-Type: application/json

{ "target": "pay", "kind": "Errors", "intensity": 0.6 }

### Ledger DB throttling
POST {{host}}/api/fake/effects
Content-Type: application/json

{ "target": "cl.ledger-db", "kind": "Saturate", "intensity": 1 }

### What is active
GET {{host}}/api/fake

### Reset everything
POST {{host}}/api/fake/reset
